/video/BV1tnBZBBEmG</guid><pubDate>Fri, 26 Dec 2025 09:30:07 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>同一款药价格差3倍，中国药价体系背后有何玄机？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115740292225855&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV18KqpBMEiw" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8bb45d2a0941100a2ba299115dcc8ff5bb647ea1.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; </description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18KqpBMEiw</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18KqpBMEiw</guid><pubDate>Thu, 18 Dec 2025 11:55:19 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>日本财团，背后有什么玄机？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115722105658349&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1ppmCBVEww" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5463615b51447f77cbefa9ce4c33c5b7927cbea5.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 财团，在日本经济的地位非常重要。 最大的三家财团：三菱、三井、住友，占据了日本国内约60%的销售额。 今天，我们挖一挖这些财团，看看这张隐秘的网络到底是怎么运作的。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ppmCBVEww</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ppmCBVEww</guid><pubDate>Mon, 15 Dec 2025 09:30:06 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>一口气了解赌球</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115699859070921&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1NQmTBmEj5" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2a72489ea5a24e6897096642f4f84cd70e65f4ea.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 其实我们今天要聊的，确切来说，是体育博彩。 这里包括线上、线下，包括赌球、赌马，包括赌场、博彩平台，也包括体育彩票。 咱们今天就来一口气聊聊，这个游走在法律边缘的产业 - 体育博彩。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1NQmTBmEj5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1NQmTBmEj5</guid><pubDate>Thu, 11 Dec 2025 10:00:50 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>GDP是会骗人的 | 一口气了解GDP</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115547555502685&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1EjCgBeEn5" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/856f17b0c01d3b40b393bc2d030e52ea56e9e9c2.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; GDP可以说是衡量各国经济最最最最常用的指标了，你以为它就是个数，不会骗人，结果却有这么多版本～ 这背后的门道可不简单。咱们今天就来聊聊这个你最熟悉，但又最会骗人的指标 - GDP。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1EjCgBeEn5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1EjCgBeEn5</guid><pubDate>Fri, 14 Nov 2025 10:26:28 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>那些被制裁最最严重的国家，都怎么样了?</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115433218774842&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1qVsRzbEQ2" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7202452a9b86ca1b00c431ca60a1d4f67cb14244.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 我们今天会通过五个最有特点、最有影响力、大家都耳熟能详的国家制裁，来深入探究一下，制裁的底层逻辑。它有哪些手段？被制裁的国家能够如何反制？ 还有最关键的，制裁到底管不管用？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qVsRzbEQ2</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qVsRzbEQ2</guid><pubDate>Sat, 25 Oct 2025 09:30:07 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>全球乱跑的"最贵"视频，看我发现了什么…？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115376411186962&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1wK4vznEW3" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/aa304f05f99987dc570f2f1aceb15393b1880230.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; </description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wK4vznEW3</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wK4vznEW3</guid><pubDate>Wed, 15 Oct 2025 09:36:31 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item><item><title>美元暴跌的背后...</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115360070114032&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV14U4uzRE1X" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3230af70dd3d8e61de0e29b4f23393260c0c1c68.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 朋友们，不知道你们有没有意识到，美元今年跌惨了，上半年是近半个世纪表现最差的一年。 下半年到现在也持续疲软，从年初到现在美元指数已经下跌了超过10%。 而与此同时，全球的资产价格都出现了久违的爆发。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV14U4uzRE1X</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV14U4uzRE1X</guid><pubDate>Sun, 12 Oct 2025 09:40:08 GMT</pubDate><author>小Lin说</author></item></channel></rss>